From: Charcoal maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: zstd: use compression level 1 by default

Use the requested level for Crypto API ZSTD consumers, including zswap.
The existing parameter and workspace calculation derives its settings from
ZSTD_DEF_LEVEL; keep the window limit and decompressor unchanged.

diff --git a/crypto/zstd.c b/crypto/zstd.c
--- a/crypto/zstd.c
+++ b/crypto/zstd.c
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@
 #include <crypto/scatterwalk.h>
 
 
-#define ZSTD_DEF_LEVEL		3
+#define ZSTD_DEF_LEVEL		1
 #define ZSTD_MAX_WINDOWLOG	18
 #define ZSTD_MAX_SIZE		BIT(ZSTD_MAX_WINDOWLOG)
 
